The bundled browser reviewer uses published React, React DOM, Scheduler,
DOMPurify, quiht-core and lucide-react. Their license texts are included in
vexy_localizzy/review_web/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt and review/public/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt.

Canonical catalog compatibility types and key/placeholder helpers in
src/vexy_localizzy/catalog.py and filename planning in
src/vexy_localizzy/tmx_names.py and literal-token QA contracts in
src/vexy_localizzy/qa_tokens.py and the explicit compatibility projections in
src/vexy_localizzy/legacy_pairs.py and the plural/device projection in
src/vexy_localizzy/apple_resources.py and Fluent projection in
src/vexy_localizzy/fluent_resources.py and the legacy converters in
src/vexy_localizzy/extract/ are adapted from fl10n, whose project metadata
